# INCM Project — Phase 0 repository exclusions
#
# Everything ignored here is either regenerable, machine-local, or a Phase 1
# artefact that must not be uploaded. The scientific results (CSV inventories,
# JSON summaries, coverage scan and the inventory report) are committed, and
# data/metadata/.generated_manifest.json carries their SHA-256 hashes so a
# reviewer can prove nothing was altered after generation.

# --- Allen RMA response cache ------------------------------------------------
# Raw cached API JSON. 102 MiB across 240 hash-named files; fully regenerable
# by re-running src/data_audit/allen_inventory.py against the live API.
data/metadata/api_cache/

# --- Run logs ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Chronological, machine-local (absolute paths + timestamps). Every run rewrites
# it, so tracking it would generate permanent noise in the history.
*.log

# --- Python bytecode / packaging ---------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# --- Test and linting caches -------------------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/

# --- Virtual environments / interpreters -------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.python
pip-wheel-metadata/

# --- Credentials and secrets -------------------------------------------------
# The Phase 0 audit needs no API key; nothing here should ever exist, but the
# patterns are pinned so a future Phase 1 token cannot be committed by accident.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.crt
credentials*
credentials.json
*_token*
.secrets*

# --- Large binary downloads (explicitly out of scope for Phase 0) ------------
# Raw NWB recordings, morphologies and downloaded neuronal model archives.
*.nwb
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.swc
*.zip
*.tar
*.gz
*.7z
*.rar
*.exe
*.msi
*.npz

# --- Temporary / scratch -----------------------------------------------------
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*.~lock.*

# --- Editors / IDE -----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.sublime-workspace

# --- Operating-system / machine-specific -------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
$RECYCLE.BIN/
